  },
  "schema:name": "Logical data structure of the MMS4 HPCA burst L2 ion CDF granules (DDI-CDI DimensionalDataStructure)",
  "schema:description": "Heterogeneous dimensional structure of each CDF granule. Dimensions: time (record), elevation anode (16), energy step (63), azimuth within half-spin (16), and field-vector component (4). Each measure lists the dimensions it actually spans via cdif:dimensionedBy; e.g. species fluxes/PSDs are time x anode x energy, per-sweep data quality is time only, the energy table is time x energy, and the B-field is time x component. Measures reference the schema:variableMeasured InstanceVariables of the dataset by @id. Physical (byte-level) representation is on the CDF distribution's cdi:hasPhysicalMapping.",
  "dcterms:conformsTo": [
    {
      "@id": "https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.1"
    }
  ],
  "schema:about": {
    "@id": "https://doi.org/10.48322/6cfb-rq65"
  },
